World2: approximate image-guided reconstruction, not an authenticated original.
Catalogue: https://www.realmeye.com/wiki/maps-of-the-realm (https://imgur.com/UsSpU3r.png).
world02.json pins image and canonical cell/audit identities; no source PNG is bundled.
Centered 2100->2048 crop at 26; inferred substrates/tiers; 20,571 reviewed unknown pixels,
including 17,561 unidentified magenta footprints; 864 safe lava visuals; 699 scenery
substitutions lose destructibility/other metadata. Normal arrivals/setpieces still apply.
Canonical cells -> WMAP is reproducible, not PNG interpretation. Historical approval labels
are not file dependencies; source_commit is prior authorship, not the current binary.
Image/derivative redistribution rights remain unverified, not granted by public hosting,
attribution, code licenses or omission of the PNG. World2 is not the MIT Perlin export.

World3: frozen 84542-1 numeric Perlin export from Amit J Patel's legacy demo
https://theory.stanford.edu/~amitp/_test/mapgen2-13.swf, linked in
https://simblob.blogspot.com/2012/02/polygon-map-generation-faq.html.
world03.json pins hashes/orientation/Ruffle identity; exact exporter revision is unverified.
