Habitats/scenery/mainland policy are reconstruction; detached islands/structures omitted;
generic lava/ice become safe water and snow becomes Snowy Rock. Neither notice relicenses
selected-client content. No client dump, exporter or sprites are bundled.

Offline rebuild without client/state/network: openrotmg build-realm --data data --id ID
IDs: classic-world-02-reconstruction, classic-world-03-reconstruction. Add --check to compare.
